:: D5_Intercept [document]
<div class="doc">
<span class="stamp stamp--red"><<ru "sekretno" "СЕКРЕТНО">></span>
<div class="doc-header"><span class="doc-org">Стенограмма · transcript</span><span class="doc-sub">Telephone conversation · 20.08.91 · 14:22 · city line</span></div>
<div class="doc-meta"><span>Subscriber A: male, unidentified (White House)</span><span>Subscriber B: male, unidentified</span></div>

<p><strong>A:</strong> …and when it's over, who runs the ministries? Not us. We don't know where anything is.</p>
<p><strong>B:</strong> Then we find people who do.</p>
<p><strong>A:</strong> From <em>there</em>? From Staraya Ploshchad?</p>
<p><strong>B:</strong> Not the secretaries. The clerks, the referents. They'll come to us themselves, you'll see. Give them a number. <<clue "aide-number">>205-41-07<</clue>>, ask for Sergei.</p>
<p><strong>A:</strong> And what do we tell them?</p>
<p><strong>B:</strong> That we'll remember who helped.</p>

